stage: cfg (debug_assert fires inside Cfg::build, before SSA construction)
panic: "catch handler must appear after all its try-region blocks in RPO"
site: src/decompile/cfg.rs:441:13
repro: cargo fuzz run fuzz_ssa fuzz/crashes/fuzz_ssa/0cfc3d8e2713

Same root cause as `fuzz_cfg/515ce46d6dac`: Invariant 7 violation in
`Cfg::build`'s post-order fixup. fuzz_ssa routes through the same
CFG construction before touching the SSA builder, so this target
surfaces the same bug class first. Both inputs are consumed by the
fix that converts the debug_assert into a typed Err.
